dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Arena",
  "description": "Optional advanced exploration. Same evidence rules as the guided labs.",
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_arena": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Arena\n\nOptional. This is after the guided curriculum. It is not the start, and it does not replace a workshop.\n\nUse the same LIVE launchers. There is no separate curriculum and no extra grant. Evidence rules are unchanged:\n\n- a control decision is not execution\n- execution is not a measured downstream resource change\n- an empty search is not DENY\n- HEC HTTP 200 is not indexed evidence\n- one RETEST is not universal protection\n\n- [Direct Prompt Injection](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-PI-001)\n- [Tool Authorization](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-MCP-001)\n- [RAG / Retrieved Context](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-RAG-CONTEXT)\n- [Persistent Memory](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-MEMORY-001)\n- [Goal / Instruction Integrity](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-AGENT-GOAL-INTEGRITY-001)\n- [Agent Identity / Delegation](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-AGENT-DELEGATION-001)\n- [Lending Assistant Investigation](/en-US/app/agentsec/open_attack?path=/labs/LAB-AGENTSEC-CAPSTONE-001)\n\nReturn to [Home](/en-US/app/agentsec/ws_agentsec_home) or [Your path](/en-US/app/agentsec/learner_path) when you want the guided sequence again.\n"
      }
    }
  },
  "dataSources": {},
  "inputs": {},
  "layout": {
    "type": "absolute",
    "options": {
      "submitButton": false,
      "submitOnDashboardLoad": true,
      "showTitleAndDescription": true
    },
    "structure": [
      {
        "item": "viz_arena",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 1440,
          "h": 640
        }
      }
    ],
    "globalInputs": []
  }
}
